# ONLYIBEE — what must never reach the deployed site.
# Added 2026-08-17 after the security audit found these being served publicly.
#
# GitHub Pages serves EVERY file in the repo as a static asset. There is no
# server-side "private" folder — if it is committed, it is downloadable. These
# entries are the difference between "local tooling" and "published".

# ---- Backend setup scripts -------------------------------------------------
# These were live at onlyibee.com/member/*.sql. They handed out the full schema,
# every RPC name and signature, the bot-filter thresholds — and vip.sql published
# a real person's private email address to anyone who asked for the URL.
# Keep them locally; run them by pasting into the Supabase SQL editor.
member/*.sql

